##############################################################################
#                                                                            #
#                           DIGITIZATION CATEGORY                            #
#                                                                            #
##############################################################################

save_DIGITIZATION
    _definition.id               DIGITIZATION
    _definition.scope            Category
    _definition.class            Set
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Data items in the digitization category record metadata relevant
    when file data were extracted/reconstructed from a static image
    of a published figure or table, rather than recorded directly
    from an instrument or simulation output. Presence of any field
    in this section implies the data were digitized; the underlying
    experimental or simulation method is still recorded via
    _exptl_method regardless.
;
    _name.category_id            AIF_CORE
    _name.object_id              DIGITIZATION
save_

save_digitization.author
    _definition.id               'digitization.author'
    _definition.scope            Item
    _definition.class            Datum
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Name of the person who digitized the data from the published
    figure or table
;
    _name.category_id            DIGITIZATION
    _name.object_id              author
    _type.purpose                Describe
    _type.source                 Recorded
    _type.container              Single
    _type.contents               Text
save_

save_digitization.date
    _definition.id               'digitization.date'
    _definition.scope            Item
    _definition.class            Datum
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Date when the data were digitized from the published figure or
    table in ISO 8601 format.
;
    _name.category_id            DIGITIZATION
    _name.object_id              date
    _type.purpose                Describe
    _type.source                 Recorded
    _type.container              Single
    _type.contents               DateTime
save_

save_digitization.method
    _definition.id               'digitization.method'
    _definition.scope            Item
    _definition.class            Datum
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    The decision making method in validating the data: solely by a
    human (human), with ML/AI assistance or AI with human review
    (AI-aided), or fully automated via ML/AI without human
    intervention (AI-automated).
;
    _name.category_id            DIGITIZATION
    _name.object_id              method
    _type.purpose                Describe
    _type.source                 Recorded
    _type.container              Single
    _type.contents               Text
    loop_
        _enumeration_set.state
        _enumeration_set.detail
        human            'Data extracted solely by a human. This does not exclude the use of software tools but indicates that data selection decisions were made exclusively by a human person.'
        AI-aided         'Data extracted in part using machine learning or AI tools, in cooperation with or verified by a human person.'
        AI-automated     'Data extracted automatically from a figure via machine learning or AI tools, without human intervention.'
save_

save_digitization.software
    _definition.id               'digitization.software'
    _definition.scope            Item
    _definition.class            Datum
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Name and version of the software or tool used to digitize the
    data, e.g. WebPlotDigitizer 4.6, Engauge Digitizer, or 'manual'
    for pixel-by-pixel manual measurement. This field must be
    present when _digitization_method is either AI-aided or AI-
    automated.
;
    _name.category_id            DIGITIZATION
    _name.object_id              software
    _type.purpose                Describe
    _type.source                 Recorded
    _type.container              Single
    _type.contents               Text
save_

save_digitization.notes
    _definition.id               'digitization.notes'
    _definition.scope            Item
    _definition.class            Datum
    _definition.update           2026-03-09
    _description.text
;
    Free-text field for any additional notes about the digitization
    process or source, like assumptions, limitations, data
    identification (e.g. which curve was digitized), or any other
    relevant information.
;
    _name.category_id            DIGITIZATION
    _name.object_id              notes
    _type.purpose                Describe
    _type.source                 Recorded
    _type.container              Single
    _type.contents               Text
save_

